The purpose of the meeting is to review and propose draft language to establish an ordinance around leaf blower use within the city in the interest of public health and safety for Medford residents, paper 21-057.

20
00:00:55,537 --> 00:00:59,979
DPW Commissioner Tim McGibbon and KP Law Attorney Janelle Austin have been invited to attend.

21
