110
00:10:25,812 --> 00:10:31,194
And I thought you might be able to give us an idea as to when the city does leaf cleanups.

111
00:10:31,635 --> 00:10:40,679
Are there certain weeks approximately that you would say are much more intense or much more focused on leaf cleanups?

112
