133
00:12:23,429 --> 00:12:30,933
But if you have an idea of what shortening it might look like and still not be too disruptive, that might be helpful.

134
00:12:31,433 --> 00:12:32,674
But yeah.

135
00:12:33,274 --> 00:12:39,197
And the application is for a commercial leaf blower use basically throughout the city, right?

136
00:12:39,738 --> 00:12:40,278
I believe so.

137
00:12:40,968 --> 00:12:56,435
Okay, yeah, I'll provide the council through the president sort of what DPW's prime date ranges for leaf cleanup is, and that'll help maybe confirm this target.

138
00:12:57,395 --> 00:12:58,976
Thank you, that would be super helpful.

139
00:12:59,676 --> 00:13:04,698
Absolutely.

140
00:13:04,718 --> 00:13:05,859
What's that, Councilor Sang?

141
00:13:07,619 --> 00:13:08,720
Great, Councilor Collins.

