170
00:16:10,683 --> 00:16:12,364
This doesn't include the school department's lands.

171
00:16:13,145 --> 00:16:14,245
Let's put our money where our mouth is.

172
00:16:14,265 --> 00:16:18,908
Why are we going to hold the commercial establishments to a higher standard than that we're going to hold ourselves to?

173
00:16:20,870 --> 00:16:21,330
Number one.

174
00:16:21,990 --> 00:16:23,691
Number two, what are we going to ban next?

175
00:16:24,492 --> 00:16:27,894
I think that we're really going a little ban-crazy lately.

176
00:16:28,074 --> 00:16:31,356
Regulate, maybe, but not ban would be a better way to do this, in my opinion.

177
00:16:33,093 --> 00:16:36,155
So those are a couple of thoughts that I have about this.

178
00:16:36,295 --> 00:16:41,198
But ultimately, I was just hoping you could read the intent of the ordinance back.

179
00:16:41,879 --> 00:16:43,500
That's usually the preamble.

180
00:16:43,600 --> 00:16:47,462
I don't mean to say the intended purpose of the ordinance, just to read that back.

181
00:16:47,542 --> 00:16:53,246
I mean, we have

182
00:16:57,103 --> 00:16:58,444
The leaf blower is regulated.

183
00:16:58,484 --> 00:17:05,487
We have the definitions, limitations on use, and enforcement regulation, severability, and effective date.

184
00:17:05,547 --> 00:17:08,769
So I think we could use language on intent.

185
00:17:09,690 --> 00:17:11,571
I think that that would be appropriate, Madam President.

186
00:17:12,811 --> 00:17:25,418
Also, I'd like to offer the motion that anybody that has a registered business that provides landscaping services be invited to a meeting, because most people that I talk to that are landscapers in this community have no idea about this proposal.

187
00:17:26,421 --> 00:17:31,145
And most of the time, especially this time of year, they're not sitting in the TV in the living room, they're out working.

188
00:17:31,806 --> 00:17:41,914
So with the good weather upon us and this season upon us, it might make sense for us to invite some of these individuals that are actually going to be impacted and affected monetarily by this.

189
00:17:44,023 --> 00:17:49,408
proposal, number one, and number two, also maybe hear from some of our friends from the Chamber of Commerce as to what they think.

190
00:17:50,029 --> 00:17:51,590
