191
00:17:51,610 --> 00:17:53,312
The cost is just going to get passed on to the consumer.

192
00:17:53,412 --> 00:18:01,080
So it might be interesting to hear what impact this is going to have on the consumer from the business owners as this proposal is anticipated through the vetting process.

193
00:18:03,642 --> 00:18:07,303
And do you want the first as far as adding, making sure the intent is included.

194
00:18:07,323 --> 00:18:13,366
Do you want that in a motion or just a recommendation to put that in the motion in the form of motion or as a recommendation committee report.

195
00:18:13,406 --> 00:18:16,107
However, you guys said, I don't think it's going to be something that's too contentious.

196
00:18:17,147 --> 00:18:21,609
So I didn't get all the language about the, about the recommendation.

197
00:18:24,050 --> 00:18:28,211
The recommendation is just to, to add the intent portion for the ordinance.

198
00:18:28,531 --> 00:18:28,811
Okay.

199
00:18:28,891 --> 00:18:29,172
Got it.

200
00:18:29,372 --> 00:18:29,592
Got it.

201
00:18:29,712 --> 00:18:29,992
Got that.

202
00:18:32,691 --> 00:18:39,955
And do I have a second on Councilor Knight's motion to invite all those registered landscaping companies within the city as well as the Chamber of Commerce.

203
00:18:40,475 --> 00:18:41,436
Second by Councilor Collins.

204
00:18:42,756 --> 00:18:44,297
Thank you.

205
00:18:44,857 --> 00:18:46,178
We can take all motions at the end.

