359
00:32:58,373 --> 00:32:59,014
Councilor Collins.

360
00:33:00,295 --> 00:33:04,077
I was just gonna motion to keep the paper in committee, but I can hold that for later.

361
00:33:04,457 --> 00:33:07,560
We just have a number of motions to vote on forehand.

362
00:33:07,640 --> 00:33:09,681
So I have, I think, five, so I can go through them.

363
00:33:09,701 --> 00:33:11,762
Motion to consolidate.

364
00:33:13,083 --> 00:33:17,867
On the motion of Councilor Knight to consolidate the five motions we have before us.

