377
00:34:02,508 --> 00:34:04,550
So that's why I have the motion written up for that one.

378
00:34:05,310 --> 00:34:06,972
I then have a motion from Councilor Knight.

379
00:34:07,452 --> 00:34:16,859
He moved to add the intent portion of the ordinance to the committee report and further moved to invite anyone with a registered landscaping or similar business to a meeting with the council.

380
00:34:17,159 --> 00:34:20,001
He said he would also like to hear from members of chamber of commerce.

381
00:34:20,866 --> 00:34:22,527
I have Councilor Collins second on that.

382
00:34:24,188 --> 00:34:35,335
I have Vice President Behrs moving to adopt language to limit constant use to one hour per day per property, pending requests to KP law as to whether this information is already covered under the noise ordinance.

383
00:34:35,816 --> 00:34:37,877
I have a second on that from Councilor Sang.

384
00:34:38,677 --> 00:34:42,620
I have Vice President Behrs moving to amend the language to include all city properties.

385
00:34:43,160 --> 00:34:44,961
And I have a second from Councilor Collins.

386
00:34:45,482 --> 00:34:50,445
And I have Vice President Behrs moving to require the commercial operators and operators on large properties

387
00:34:50,805 --> 00:34:52,326
