388
00:34:52,346 --> 00:34:54,128
And I have a second from Councilor Collins on that.

389
00:34:55,029 --> 00:34:55,329
Correct.

390
00:34:55,489 --> 00:34:57,531
That is everything I have.

391
00:34:58,392 --> 00:34:58,972
Any councilors?

392
00:34:59,032 --> 00:34:59,273
Great.

393
00:34:59,333 --> 00:35:00,454
Looks like everyone agrees.

394
00:35:01,715 --> 00:35:02,776
If I may, Madam President.

395
00:35:03,376 --> 00:35:04,157
Vice President Behrs.

396
00:35:04,758 --> 00:35:16,008
I would just say on the motion to include all city properties, it would be to replace the current listing of city properties with just a phrase that incorporates all city properties.

397
00:35:33,338 --> 00:35:36,379
