00:36:17,625 --> 00:36:19,986
I believe councilor Scarpelli is still absent as well.

416
00:36:21,066 --> 00:36:21,727
Councilor Seng.

417
00:36:22,327 --> 00:36:22,487
Yes.

418
00:36:23,147 --> 00:36:23,728
President Morrell.

